  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, due to its inappropriate height, bulk and proximity to and relationship with neighbouring houses would be an overbearing and visually intrusive form of development leading to a loss of outlook and creating a sense of enclosure harming neighbours living conditions. It would therefore be contrary to Local Plan policy CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture). ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, due to its inappropriate location, dimensions and lack of information would result in harm to highway and pedestrian safety. It would therefore be contrary to Local Plan policy EC2 (Developing a Sustainable Local Transport Network)."
